  "modifications": "Converted official FBX to independent named Draco GLB structures; removed annotation-helper geometry; applied FBX hierarchy transforms and converted centimetres to metres; 18-bit position quantization. Mirrored transform winding corrected. No anatomical meshes invented. Original FBX Tendon material faces restored as scalar masks; optional 1.5 mm display feather remains inside authored tendon faces. Original geometry, identifiers and bounds retained. Source-authored Tendon boundary interpolation repaired with planar edge midpoint/face centroid display subdivisions. Original anatomical surfaces and source IDs retained; render tessellation is not additional anatomical detail. Cool off-white nonmetal display material, roughness 0.52, and per-mesh inside-boundary feather capped at 3 mm. Four whole original peritoneal folds added without changing geometry, material attributes or coordinates. Peritoneum remains partial; no parietal peritoneum is supplied. Appended whole original intestinal, mesenteric arterial, portal venous and lymph-node source resources. No original geometry or physical identities altered. Source lower-bowel surfaces, taeniae and disputed AIPDA surface remain outside Connected body membership.",
